{
  "about": "Reflow rules of Agent Browser Protocol §5.1 and §5.2. normalize: url -> normalized URL, site, page, and view (the page shown when the site has a package and a result). invalid: URLs that have no reflow page. match: whether a package whose manifest has this `match` applies to the URL.",
